      "printf",
      "\"Welcome to the Cyberpunk Haunted House Simulator!\\n\\n\"",
      "printf",
      "\"You are walking down a dark alley and come across an old, run-down building.\\n\"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "\"As you approach it, the door creaks open and you can see a dim light coming from inside.\\n\\n\"",
