      "printf",
      "\"The furniture is old and covered in dust, but the room is otherwise empty.\\n\"",
      "printf",
      "\"As you leave the living room, you enter a small kitchen. \"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "\"The cabinets are all open and the drawers are empty, but you notice something strange -\\n\"",
      "printf",
      "\"there is a piece of paper on the counter, with the word HELP written on it.\\n\"",
      ";",
      ";",
