      "'y'",
      "printf",
      "\"You cautiously approach the refrigerator and slowly pull it away from the wall. \"",
      "printf",
      "\"To your horror, you see a group of zombies staring back at you! \"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "\"You quickly run back to the living room and barricade the door.\\n\"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "}",
      "elbe",
      "printf",
      "\"You decide not to investigate and leave the kitchen. \"",
