      "\"As you step into the room, you feel a cold breeze and see a ghostly apparition! \"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "(",
      "\"You try to leave the room but the door slams shut and you're trapped with the ghost.\\n\"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "\"GAME OVER\\n\"",
      ";",
