      "\"The room is empty except for a bed covered in cobwebs and dust.\\n\"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "}",
      "printf",
      "\"You climb up to the attic and find a small, hidden room at the back. \"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "\"Inside, you find a dusty old computer and a note that reads:\\n\"",
      "printf",
      "\"WELCOME TO THE SIMULATOR! YOU ARE NOW TRAPPED IN A VIRTUAL REALITY WORLD.\\n\"",
      "printf",
      "\"THE ONLY WAY TO ESCAPE IS TO WIN THE GAME BY FINDING THE HIDDEN KEY IN THE NEXT ROOM.\\n\\n\"",
      "printf",
