      "\"At the end of the hall, you see a faint light and hear a strange noise.\\n\"",
      ";",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "\"As you approach the room, you see a shadowy figure standing in front of a large chest. \"",
      "printf",
      "\"The figure turns around and reveals its true form - a demonic creature with razor-sharp claws!\\n\"",
      "printf",
